## 5. Desktop ↔ Web auth & embed contract (one account, many devices)

> **عربي:** قسم — 5.1 Login continuum (EXE → Web → Desktop activated)

### 5.1 Login continuum (EXE → Web → Desktop activated)

Required product loop:
1. User opens **Vigil Desktop (EXE)** without a session (or taps Login / Upgrade).
2. Desktop opens **User Web login** (system browser and/or embedded WebView — TBD).
3. User signs in / signs up on web (Firebase Auth); optional free-tier grant on first signup.
4. Auth handoff returns to desktop (`custom URL scheme` / loopback / token bridge — TBD).
5. Desktop shows **same account activated**: name, plan tier, wallet remaining, shared chat history.
6. User may later Buy on web; desktop entitlement refreshes from Firestore without new signup.

- [ ] Desktop never invents a second password store as SoR — Firebase Auth is identity
- [ ] After handoff, desktop session survives relaunch until logout
- [ ] Logout on one surface can optionally revoke refresh elsewhere (policy TBD); default Phase 1: independent device sessions, same account

> **عربي:** قسم — 5.2 Multi-device policy

### 5.2 Multi-device policy

- [ ] **No hard device limit** in Phase 1 — laptop, phone web, office PC, etc. all OK
- [ ] Every surface consumes from the **same wallet / subscription**
- [ ] `devices` / `sessions` collection is for visibility & security audit, **not** seat licensing
- [ ] Concurrent use allowed; metering is account-global (race-safe decrements)

> **عربي:** قسم — 5.3 Embed + bridge events

### 5.3 Embed + bridge events

Desktop will also host Vigil Web (WebView / iframe / embedded browser) so history UX is identical.

Web must support:
- 🟨 **Embed-safe mode** (`?embed=1` + `/app` SiteNavGate) — hide marketing chrome
- 🟨 **Auth token / session bridge** — `/embed/auth` + desktop idToken → `/api/session`
- 🟨 **postMessage / bridge events**:
 - ✅ `vigil:auth-handoff` / `vigil:auth-request` / `vigil:session-ready`
 - [ ] `vigil:entitlement-updated` (tier / wallet after pay or free grant)
 - [ ] `vigil:plan-approve` / `vigil:plan-updated`
 - ✅ `vigil:request-execute` → desktop Plan Mode Execute
 - 🟨 `vigil:execution-status` ← embed chip + Firestore + web PlanLiveStatus poll
- 🟨 Deep links: `/login`, `/pricing`, `/plans/:id`, `/chats/:id`, `/projects/:id` (checkout later)
- [ ] “Continue on Desktop” that opens/focuses VigilAIAgent when installed

Desktop must:
- [ ] Show same account history via this embed (preferred over a second native chat SoR UI)
- [ ] Keep local Execute / terminal / LSP outside the iframe
- [ ] Refresh entitlements after web checkout (listener or poll on `subscriptions` / `wallets`)

